<!-- ============== SECTION 4 — FOUNDER NOTE ============== -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap founder-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">A note from Dr. Turley</div>
      <p class="pullquote">
       "I built Revive Teeth for patients I've seen in my practice for years — people who want their smile to look
        right in photos again, but aren' t ready to commit to $15, 000 and permanent enamel removal. That choice should
        exist."
      </p>
      <div class="founder-body">
        <p>
          Most snap-on veneers are cheaply manufactured plastic, shipped from factories by companies that don't have a
          practicing dentist on their team. I've watched patients walk into my practice wearing them, embarrassed by
          something they paid for and stopped wearing within a month.
        </p>
        <p>
          That's the gap Revive Veneers fills. Every case is designed against my 7-point smile design protocol. The same
          commitment to quality I apply in my own practice. If it doesn't pass, it doesn't ship. If it arrives and isn't
          right, we remake it. If we still can't get it right, you get your money back.
        </p>
        <p>My name is on this because I built it. Welcome.</p>
      </div>
      <img
        src="{{ 'signature.png' | asset_url }}"
        alt="Dr. Brandon Turley"
        class="sig-img"
        height="100"
        width="100"
      >
      <div class="sig-sub">Doctor of Dental Surgery · Founder, Revive Teeth</div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="portrait"
    >
      <img
        src="{{ 'founder-image.jfif' | asset_url }}"
        alt="
          Dr. Brandon Turley,
          DDS
       "
        height="100"
        width="100"
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

